This matches what you saw: open the app at 08:00, then again at 08:03 after the U3 has left Coimbra B, and a bus arriving sooner than ones already listed[1C"appears".[1CIt[1Calso[13;3Hhappens[1Cwhile[1Cthe[1Capp[1Cstays[1Copen,[1Csince[1Cthe[1Clist[1Crecalculates[1Cevery[1Csecond.[1COver[1Cevery[1Cstop[1Cin[1C5-minute[1Csteps[1Cfrom[1C06:00[1Cto[1C22:00[1Con[1Ca[1Cweekday,[1Cthe[1Clist's[1Cfirst[1Cbus[1Cwas[1Cmissing[14;3Hor wrong in [1m12.1%[22m[1Cof cases[1C(882[1Cof 7,296).[1C[K[15;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [1m[16;3HTwo related side effects[22m[K[18;3H1. [1mEnd-of-line stops only list buses arriving to finish there.[22m[1CAt[1CCoimbra[1CB[1Cat[1C08:00,[1Cthe[1Capp[1Cshows[1C4[1Cbuses,[1Call[1Cending[1Cat[1CCoimbra[1CB.[1CThe[1Cdepartures[1Cyou[1Ccould[1Cactually[1Cboard[1C(U1[19;6H→[1CVale[1Cdas[1CFlores[1C08:15,[1CS1[1C→[1CSerpins[1C08:20)[1Cnever[1Cappear,[1Cbecause[1Ca[1Ctrip[1Cis[1Cnever[1C"heading[1Cto"[1Cits[1Cown[1Cfirst[1Cstop.[38;2;177;185;249m[1CdirectionsAtStop[m[1C([38;2;177;185;249msrc/domain/directions.ts:22[m)[1Calso[1Cignores[20;3H  [1Cfirst-stop calls, so the direction filter at these stops is[1Caffected in the[1Csame way.                                                                                          [21;3H2.[1CThe [1Cist is cut to 4 rows ([38;2;177;185;249msrc/ui/sheet/ApproachingBuses.tsx:8[m), so a bus[1C36[1Cminutes away can fill a row tha[2Cbelongs to one 6 minutes away.                                   [22;6H                                                                                                                                                                               [1m[23;3HHow to fix it[22m[K[25;3HBuild the list[1Cfrom[1Cthe[1Ctimetable,[1Cseparately[1Cfrom[1Cwhich[1Cbuses[1Care[1Con[1Cthe[1Cmap:[26;3H-[1CThe[1Csheet[1Clists[1Cthe[1Cnext[1Cscheduled[1Ccalls[1Cat[1Cthe[1Cstop,[1Cincluding[1Ctrips[1Cthat[1Chaven't[1Cstarted[1C(optionally[1Cwithin[1Ca[1Ctime[1Climit).[1CAt[1Can[1Cend-of-line[1Cstop,[1Cthat[1Cincludes[1Cbuses[1Cleaving[27;3H  from there, and buses[2Chat finish the[1Ce are[1Cp[2Cbably left out.[K[28;9Hmap keep[1C [1Chowing only buses in service, or[2Ch[1Cws[1Ca not-yet-started bus [1Ct its[1Cfirs[1C stop marked "departs[1C08:15".                                                           [29;3H-[1CA new t[1Cst covers a [1Ctop where t[1Ce soonest bus h[1Csn't left i[1Cs[1Cfirst[1Cstop[1Cyet.[30;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [31;3HThis fits the empty[38;2;177;185;249m[1Cplays/010-data-validation [mplay, if that's where you want i[3CHow[1Cto[1Cshow[1Ca[1Cbus[1Cthat[1Chasn't[1Cleft[1Cyet[1C("in[1C6[1Cmin"[1Cor[1C"departs[1C08:15")[1Cand[1Cwhether[1Cbuses[1Cthat[32;3Hfinish[1Cat[1Cthe[1Cstop[1Cstay[1Cin[1Cits[1Clist[1Care[1Cyour[1Ccalls.[1CTell[1Cme[1Cand[1CI'll[1Cwrite[1Cthe[1Cintent[1Cand[1Cimplement[1Cit.[33;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [38;2;153;153;153m✻[1CBaked for 2m 44s · done 10:45[K[36;1H※[1m[1Crecap: [22m[3mI looked into why the bus list changes between runs: the list only shows buses that have left their first stop, so earlier-arriving buses pop in later. Next, you decide [37;3Hhow not-yet-departed buses should appear, and I'll implement the fix. (disable recaps in /config)[m
