es[1Caway.[20;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [1m[21;3HHow to fix it[22m[22;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [23;3HBuild[1Cthe[1Clist[1Cfrom[1Cthe[1Ctimetable,[1Cseparately[1Cfrom[1Cwhich[1Cbuses[1Care[1Con[1Cthe[1Cmap:[24;3H- The[1Cs[2Cet lists the next scheduled c[1Clls at[1Cthe stop, including trips that haven't[1Cstarted[1C(optionally[1Cwithin[1Ca[1Ctime[1Climit).[1CAt[1Can[1Cend-of-line[1Cstop,[1Cthat[1Cincludes[1Cbuses[1Cleaving[25;3H [1Cfrom th[1Cre, and[1Cbuses that finish there are[1Cprobably left out.                                                                                                                  [26;3H-[1CThe map k[1Ceps showing[1Conly[1Cbuse[1C in servic[1C, or shows a not-yet-started[1Cbus[1Cat[1Cits[1Cfirst[1Cstop[1Cmarked[1C"departs[1C08:15".[27;5HA new test covers a st[1Cp where the soonest bus hasn't[1Cleft its first stop yet.[1C[K[28;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [29;3HThis[1Cfits[1Cthe[1Cempty[38;2;177;185;249m[1Cplays/010-data-validation[m[1Cplay,[1Cif[1Cthat's[1Cwhere[1Cyou[1Cwant[1Cit.[1CHow[1Cto[1Cshow[1Ca[1Cbus[1Cthat[1Chasn't[1Cleft[1Cyet[1C("in[1C6[1Cmin"[1Cor[1C"departs[1C08:15")[1Cand[1Cwhether[1Cbuses[1Cthat[30;3Hfinish at[5Cstop stay in its list are your ca[1Cls.[1CTell me and I'll write [1Che intent and implement it.[1C                                                                          [31;3H                                                                                    